            "text": "It is a reasonable budget whey. Per the label, it gives 30 g of protein for about 180 to 190 calories, from whey concentrate and isolate, at about $1.15 per 25 g. The trade-offs are fillers such as maltodextrin, two artificial sweeteners and no third-party certification we could find. Buyers on Meijer.com gave the chocolate an average of about 4.2 stars when we looked."
