            "text": "At Meijer.com's listed prices in November 2026, tubs ran from about $21 for a 1 lb Orgain plant tub to $79.59 for a 3.89 lb Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard tub. Meijer's own 2 lb whey was $26.99. Per 25 g of protein, that is about $1.12 to $2.64. Prices vary by store, flavor and weekly sales."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the cheapest protein powder at Meijer?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
